<title>JAPAN: Bellsystem 24 shares hit record high.</title>
<headline>Bellsystem 24 shares hit record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Bellsystem 24 Inc, a telemarketer and part of the CSK group, hit a record high on Friday, cheered by the firm's solid earnings reports announced on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0142 GMT, the share price was up 500 yen at 17,800. Its volume was about 21,000 shares.</p>
